    "result_text": "The build is green. Here's what I implemented.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `POST /api/owners` pipeline already had an `audit` step (`AuditOwnerCreated`) emitting a human-readable line. I extended it to *also* emit the required immutable structured event on the same `AUDIT` logger, keeping the original line intact.\n\n**New file \u2014 `OwnerCreatedEvent.java`** (`.../rest/function/owner/`)\nAn immutable Java `record` (`seq, ownerId, customerCode, membershipLevel, event`). A record makes every field final so the event can't be mutated after emission. Field declaration order matches the spec, so Jackson serializes it as `{\"seq\":\u2026,\"ownerId\":\u2026,\"customerCode\":\u2026,\"membershipLevel\":\u2026,\"event\":\"OWNER_CREATED\"}`. A convenience constructor fixes the `event` marker to `OWNER_CREATED`.\n\n**Edited \u2014 `AuditOwnerCreated.java`**\n- A `static final AtomicLong SEQUENCE` gives a **monotonically increasing `seq` across all creates** (incremented once per created owner).\n- Builds the event and logs it as JSON via a `JsonMapper` (Jackson 3 \u2014 already on the main classpath; its serialization throws only unchecked exceptions, so the step signature stays clean).\n- The identifier value comes from a single private `primaryIdentifier(Owner)` method that today returns `customerCode`. This is the deliberate seam the spec asks for: **when the customerCode is later unified into the memberId, that one method returns the memberId and the event carries it instead** \u2014 a one-line change. (The JSON key stays `customerCode` per the spec's exact shape for now.)\n\n**Verification**\nThe existing acceptance test `coreEventCarriesIdAndIdentifier` passes \u2014 it asserts one AUDIT message contains `OWNER_CREATED`, the owner id, and the owner's `customerCode`. Observed output:\n\n```\nINFO AUDIT - Created owner id=11 customerCode=NSW-16E6609E registrationDate=2026-09-04 membershipLevel=1 membershipNumber=NSW-16E6609E-M27\nINFO AUDIT - {\"seq\":1,\"ownerId\":11,\"customerCode\":\"NSW-16E6609E\",\"membershipLevel\":1,\"event\":\"OWNER_CREATED\"}\n```\n\n`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
